---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { FOUNDER_LINKEDIN, FOUNDER_NAME, FOUNDER_ROLE, WHATSAPP_BASE_URL } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About Xpandor | Retail Expansion Partners"
	description="Learn how Xpandor takes single-point ownership of the operational complexity behind physical retail expansion across Bengaluru and South India."
>
	<!-- Hero Section: Architectural Drafting Frame -->
	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="hero-drafting-frame architectural-frame">
				<!-- Top Datum Bar -->
				<div class="datum-bar">
					<div class="datum-left">
						<span class="datum-tag">ENTERPRISE OVERVIEW</span>
						<span class="datum-sep">/</span>
						<span class="datum-text">THE PHYSICAL EXPANSION THESIS</span>
					</div>
					<div class="datum-right">
						<span class="datum-coord">BENGALURU HQ • SOUTH INDIA</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="hero-body">
					<div class="hero-eyebrow-wrap">
						<span class="eyebrow">Enterprise Overview</span>
					</div>

					<h1 class="page-title">
						The operational partner behind <br class="hidden-sm" />
						<span class="text-gradient-brass">physical retail growth.</span>
					</h1>

					<p class="page-subhead">
						We founded Xpandor around a simple commercial reality: expanding a retail brand into physical locations shouldn't require managing seven disconnected vendors. We take complete ownership of the difficult middle between the expansion plan and open trading doors.
					</p>

					<div class="hero-actions">
						<a 
							href={`${WHATSAPP_BASE_URL}?text=Hi%20Preetham,%20I'd%20like%20to%20discuss%20our%20retail%20expansion%20with%20Xpandor.`}
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							class="btn btn-gold"
						>
							<span>Discuss Expansion with Preetham</span>
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
						</a>
						<a href="#thesis" class="btn btn-outline">
							<span>Read Master Thesis ↓</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- The Thesis: Monograph Callout -->
	<section id="thesis" class="section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="manifesto-card architectural-frame">
				<span class="eyebrow">The Expansion Thesis</span>
				<blockquote class="manifesto-quote">
					“Xpandor takes ownership of the operational complexity behind physical expansion. A brand wants to go from ‘We want to open in Bengaluru’ to ‘Our store is open and trading.’ We manage the difficult middle.”
				</blockquote>
				<div class="manifesto-text-cols">
					<p class="manifesto-p">
						In traditional retail expansion, a brand is forced to separately brief a broker, negotiate a landlord lease, instruct an architect, bid out a general contractor, coordinate MEP engineers, commission a signage workshop, and brief a staffing recruiter. The issue is not that these specialist trades don't exist; the issue is that the brand's expansion head has to arbitrate all of them.
					</p>
					<p class="manifesto-p">
						This fragmentation creates cost leakage, duplicated line items, unaligned site timelines, and zero single accountability when opening dates slip. Xpandor brings all four disciplines under a single master governance: <strong>One client. One expansion team. One accountable partner.</strong>
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- The 4 Core Principles -->
	<section class="section principles-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="section-header">
				<span class="eyebrow">Operating Principles</span>
				<h2 class="section-title">Four foundations that guide our delivery.</h2>
				<p class="section-desc">
					Our differentiation is rooted in on-ground execution advantages across South Indian commercial corridors.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="grid-2">
				<div class="card-principle architectural-frame">
					<div class="principle-top">
						<span class="p-num">01</span>
						<span class="p-tag">INTELLIGENCE</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="p-title">Ground-Level Market Intelligence</h3>
					<p class="p-text">
						We do not simply scrape public property portals. We maintain direct relationships with building owners, local commercial brokers, shopkeepers, building managers, and local operators. This gives our clients access to off-market retail spaces before leases expire.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="card-principle architectural-frame">
					<div class="principle-top">
						<span class="p-num">02</span>
						<span class="p-tag">COMMERCIALS</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="p-title">Unit Economics Discipline</h3>
					<p class="p-text">
						Our objective is not merely to find an attractive storefront. It is to secure a commercial space that works for that particular retailer's unit economics: sustainable rent-to-sales ratios, proper frontage width, pedestrian footfall, and favorable lease structures.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="card-principle architectural-frame">
					<div class="principle-top">
						<span class="p-num">03</span>
						<span class="p-tag">ACCOUNTABILITY</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="p-title">Direct Execution Ownership</h3>
					<p class="p-text">
						Our team directly controls the entire project chain: scope definition, BOQ pricing, vendor management, on-site supervision, line-by-line quality inspection, and client updates. When a specialist trade executes on site, Xpandor retains total delivery accountability.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="card-principle architectural-frame">
					<div class="principle-top">
						<span class="p-num">04</span>
						<span class="p-tag">GOVERNANCE</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="p-title">One Accountable Master Team</h3>
					<p class="p-text">
						You never have to mediate between an architect blaming a contractor, or a contractor blaming a signmaker. You have one senior point of contact who owns the target opening date from initial site search to open trading doors.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Leadership & Direct Accountability -->
	<section class="section leadership-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="leadership-frame architectural-frame">
				<div class="leader-text">
					<span class="eyebrow">Principal Leadership</span>
					<h2 class="leader-title">{FOUNDER_NAME}</h2>
					<p class="leader-role">{FOUNDER_ROLE}</p>
					<p class="leader-bio">
						“I've directed site work during my time in the signage industry, been a carpenter myself, been an entrepreneur and created hiring systems in retail orgs. So, I understand the intricacies of new store rollouts, commercial siting, fit-out execution, and retail team recruitment across Bengaluru and South India. I'll be hands-on for every client project.”
					</p>
					<div class="leader-actions">
						<a 
							href={`${WHATSAPP_BASE_URL}?text=Hi%20Preetham,%20I'd%20like%20to%20discuss%20our%20retail%20expansion%20with%20you.`}
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							class="btn btn-gold"
						>
							<span>WhatsApp Preetham Direct</span>
						</a>
						<a 
							href={FOUNDER_LINKEDIN} 
							target="_blank" 
							rel="noopener noreferrer" 
							class="btn btn-outline"
						>
							<span>LinkedIn Profile ↗</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="leader-specs">
					<div class="leader-monogram">PP</div>
					<div class="spec-quote">
						“Retail expansion is an operational sport. Brands don't need another list of vendors; they need someone to own the difficult middle between the strategy deck and open doors.”
					</div>
					<div class="spec-meta">
						<span>BANGALORE HQ</span>
						<span>•</span>
						<span>SOUTH INDIA FOOTPRINT</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.page-hero {
		padding: 4.5rem 0 3rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.page-hero {
			padding: 2.5rem 0 2rem;
		}
	}

	.hero-drafting-frame {
		background: var(--bg-surface);
		border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.datum-bar {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		background: rgba(11, 13, 19, 0.6);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.datum-bar {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: flex-start;
			gap: 0.4rem;
			padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
		}
	}

	.datum-left {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.datum-tag {
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.datum-sep {
		color: var(--text-subdued);
	}

	.datum-text {
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.datum-coord {
		color: var(--text-subdued);
	}

	.hero-body {
		padding: 4rem 3.5rem;
		max-width: 900px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.hero-body {
			padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
		}
	}

	.hero-eyebrow-wrap {
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.page-title {
		font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4.8vw, 3.6rem);
		font-weight: 600;
		line-height: 1.15;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
		margin: 0.6rem 0 1.25rem;
		color: var(--text-main);
	}

	.page-subhead {
		font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem);
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
	}

	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	/* Manifesto Card */
	.manifesto-card {
		background: var(--bg-surface);
		padding: 4rem 3.5rem;
		border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.manifesto-card {
			padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
		}
	}

	.manifesto-quote {
		font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 1.8rem);
		font-weight: 600;
		line-height: 1.45;
		color: var(--text-main);
		margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem;
		padding-left: 1.75rem;
		border-left: 2px solid var(--border-brass);
	}

	.manifesto-text-cols {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 2.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		padding-top: 2rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.manifesto-text-cols {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}
	}

	.manifesto-p {
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin: 0;
	}

	/* Principles Grid */
	.principles-section {
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		background: #090B10;
	}

	.grid-2 {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.grid-2 {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	.card-principle {
		background: var(--bg-surface);
		padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
		border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.principle-top {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.p-num {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--accent-gold);
	}

	.p-tag {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		color: var(--text-subdued);
	}

	.p-title {
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
		color: var(--text-main);
	}

	.p-text {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin: 0;
	}

	/* Leadership Section */
	.leadership-frame {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 380px;
		background: var(--bg-surface);
		border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	@media (max-width: 960px) {
		.leadership-frame {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	.leader-text {
		padding: 4rem 3.5rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.leader-text {
			padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
		}
	}

	.leader-title {
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
		font-weight: 600;
		margin: 0.6rem 0 0.25rem;
		color: var(--text-main);
	}

	.leader-role {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
	}

	.leader-bio {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.leader-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.leader-specs {
		padding: 3.5rem 2.5rem;
		background: rgba(11, 13, 19, 0.7);
		border-left: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		text-align: center;
	}

	@media (max-width: 960px) {
		.leader-specs {
			border-left: none;
			border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
			padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
		}
	}

	.leader-monogram {
		width: 72px;
		height: 72px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-brass);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		background: var(--bg-surface);
	}

	.spec-quote {
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-style: italic;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.spec-meta {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}
</style>
